    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Bleeding Heart of Urgathoa",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "Red ichor drips from the heart-shaped warshard embedded in Illcayna's chest. This warshard functions as a Symbol of Conflict (Greater), except it's attuned only to Urgathoa. As long as Illcayna exists, non-Urgathoans can't use the warshard even if it's removed. If Illcayna dies, the warshard acts as a regular greater symbol of conflict."
    },
