    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Pallid Plague",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "disease",
        "divine",
        "virulent"
      ],
      "text": "Saving Throw DC 27 Fortitude save\n\n---\nStage 1 carrier (3 days)\n\nStage 2 3d8 void damage and Doomed 1 (1 day)\n\nStage 3 3d8 void damage, doomed 1, and Drained 1 (1 day)\n\nStage 4 4d8 void damage, Doomed 2, and drained 1 (1 day)\n\nStage 5 4d8 void damage, Doomed 3, and Drained 2 (1 day)\n\nStage 6 dead.\n\nA creature that dies while infected with pallid plague rises as a Wight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Reap",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Illcayna makes a Reaper's Sigh Strike and compares the attack roll result to the ACs of two foes who must both be within her melee reach. Roll damage only once, and apply it to each creature hit. Reap counts as two attacks for Illcayna's multiple attack penalty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Wake the Dead",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per minute\n\nRequirements Illcayna is adjacent to a creature that died within the last minute\n\n---\nEffect Illcayna animates the dead with a touch of her hand. The creature must succeed at a DC 29 Will save save or arise as a Wight. These wights automatically become loyal to Illcayna and independently act in her interest and follow her command until destroyed.",
